&lt;span style="font-family: &amp;apos;ＭＳ ゴシック&amp;apos;; font-size: 10px"&gt;（注）４&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style="vertical-align: middle; width: 44px; padding-top: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px; border-left: 1px solid #000000; border-top: 1px solid #000000; border-right: 1px solid #000000; border-bottom: 1px solid #000000; background-color: #FFFFFF"&gt;
&lt;p style="line-height: 15px; margin-right: 12px; text-align: right"&gt;
&lt;span style="font-family: &amp;apos;ＭＳ ゴシック&amp;apos;; font-size: 10px"&gt;－&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr style="height: 21px"&gt;
&lt;td colspan="5" style="vertical-align: middle; width: 608.66666666666666666666666667px; padding-top: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px; border-left: 1px solid #000000; border-top: 1px solid #000000; border-right: 1px solid #000000; border-bottom: 1px solid #000000; background-color: #FFFFFF"&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-left: 286.66666666666666666666666667px; line-height: 15px; text-align: center"&gt;
&lt;span style="font-family: &amp;apos;ＭＳ ゴシック&amp;apos;; font-size: 10px"&gt;計&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style="vertical-align: middle; width: 44px; padding-top: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px; border-left: 1px solid #000000; border-top: 1px solid #000000; border-right: 1px solid #000000; border-bottom: 1px solid #000000; background-color: #FFFFFF"&gt;
&lt;p style="line-height: 15px; margin-right: 5px; text-align: right"&gt;
&lt;span style="font-family: &amp;apos;ＭＳ ゴシック&amp;apos;; font-size: 10px"&gt;79&lt;/span&gt;
